  "ruleText": "Saf-C 102.01 Statutory Reference. The New Hampshire department of safety is organized in accordance with the provisions of RSA 21-P.\n\nSource. #2286, eff 1-19-83; ss by #2789, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5062, eff 2-1-91; ss by #6442, INTERIM, eff 2-1-97, EXPIRES 6-1-97; ss by #6486, eff 4-16-97",
